Subject: [PATCH] Reuse decoded request readers on the queue thread

Only --thread-pool-size=0 changes. Reuse the validated descriptor reader
instead of walking the chain and decoding its header twice. Keep dispatch
validation common; parsed lock payloads retain their existing path.

